{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42911","headline":"题贾岛墓 · 安錡","name":"题贾岛墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倚恃才难继，昂藏貌不恭。\n骑驴冲大尹，夺卷忤宣宗。\n驰誉超先辈，居官下我侬。\n司仓旧曹署，一见一心忡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"安錡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}